  - key: License Test
    text: License Test
  - key: Begin Corps training with movement, jumping, and checkpoints.
    text: Begin Corps training with movement, jumping, and checkpoints.
  - key: Qualify with the pistol and clear moving training targets.
    text: Qualify with the pistol and clear moving training targets.
  - key: Turn shotgun recoil into a movement tool.
    text: Turn shotgun recoil into a movement tool.
  - key: Combine rifle control, sliding, and courier momentum.
    text: Combine rifle control, sliding, and courier momentum.
  - key: Breach barriers and redirect yourself with explosive force.
    text: Breach barriers and redirect yourself with explosive force.
  - key: Pass the timed exam and earn your Space Delivery Corps license.
    text: Pass the timed exam and earn your Space Delivery Corps license.
  - key: Blue Man
    text: Blue Man
  - key: Blue Guy
    text: Blue Guy
  - key: Welcome, recruit. You are training to join the Space Delivery Corps.
    text: Welcome aboard, rookie! Survive training and you might just earn a place
      in the Space Delivery Corps.
  - key: Couriers cross dangerous places where normal deliveries cannot go. Start
      with the basics. Use WASD to move and SPACE to jump.
    text: 'We deliver where sane people won''t. Let''s start easy: WASD to move,
      SPACE to jump.'
  - key: This course hangs in open space, but the training recovery system is active.
      If you fall, it will return you to your latest checkpoint.
    text: And yes, that's open space below you. Fall off and recovery will pull you
      back to the last checkpoint. Probably with your dignity intact.
  - key: Checkpoint confirmed. Your training record has been updated.
    text: Checkpoint locked! If space eats you, you're coming back here.
  - key: Next is sprinting. Hold SHIFT while moving to build the speed a field courier
      needs.
    text: Walking is cute. Couriers run. Move and hold SHIFT to pick up speed.
  - key: Use a sprint jump to clear the gap ahead. Trust the recovery system if you
      miss.
    text: Sprint, jump, clear the gap. Miss it? Recovery gets the first laugh, then
      brings you back.
  - key: Good work, recruit. One movement section remains.
    text: Not bad, rookie. One last movement section.
  - key: Cross the three platforms ahead and reach the trial exit.
    text: Three platforms, one exit. Keep moving and try not to admire the void.
  - key: Complete this course and report to weapons training. A licensed courier
      must be ready for hostile delivery zones.
    text: Reach the exit and report to weapons training. Out there, some customers
      shoot before signing for the package.
  - key: Welcome to weapons training. Your first courier sidearm is the pistol.
    text: Welcome to weapons training. Here's your pistol - the Corps' answer to
      rude customers.
  - key: Shoot all six targets to verify your aim and activate the next platform.
    text: Drop all six targets and the next platform is yours. Nice and simple.
  - key: Static target calibration complete. Now prove you can aim under pressure.
    text: Hitting targets is easy without a time limit. Let's see how you handle
      the pressure.
  - key: Land on the platform and shoot all three moving targets before they reach
      the end. If one escapes, the training sequence resets.
    text: Land on the platform and hit all three movers before they escape. Lose
      one and we reset the whole show.
  - key: Pass this section and the next course will teach you how weapons can control
      your movement.
    text: 'Clear this and I''ll show you the fun part: using guns to move yourself.'
  - key: In real delivery zones, your weapon is more than protection. Recoil can
      become a movement tool.
    text: Out there, a gun isn't just protection. Point it the right way and recoil
      becomes an engine.
  - key: Every weapon applies a different amount of force. Learning that force can
      keep a courier alive.
    text: Every gun pushes differently. Learn the recoil and it might save your delivery
      - and your skin.
  - key: This course uses the shotgun. Jump and fire at the ground beneath you to
      boost upward.
    text: Grab the shotgun. Jump, fire at the ground, and let recoil introduce you
      to flight.
  - key: Remember this before you enter a live delivery zone.
    text: Remember this trick. Real delivery zones won't give you a practice run.
  - key: The shotgun gives you a stronger push when you fire at a nearby surface
      than when you fire into open space.
    text: The closer the surface, the harder the shotgun throws you. Physics is finally
      being helpful.
  - key: Use that extra force to reach the next platform.
    text: Use that kick and launch yourself to the next platform.
  - key: Good. Now combine weapon handling with movement.
    text: Good. Now let's mix shooting and movement - try to keep all limbs attached.
  - key: Use the pistol to clear the targets and activate the platform.
    text: Clear the targets with the pistol and wake up that platform.
  - key: Then use the shotgun to reach the finish. Face away from it, move BACKWARD,
      and fire to push yourself toward the exit.
    text: Then switch to the shotgun. Face away from the exit, move BACKWARD, fire,
      and ride the kick to the finish.
  - key: This trial adds the rifle, the Corps standard for sustained fire. Keep moving
      while you clear groups of targets.
    text: 'Meet the rifle: loud, fast, and very good at clearing a route. Keep moving
      while you work.'
  - key: Its recoil gives only a small movement push. Its strength is clearing several
      threats without breaking your flow.
    text: It won't launch you far, but it shreds targets without killing your momentum.
  - key: Clear the seven targets ahead to open the first gate.
    text: Seven targets between you and the gate. Make them disappear.
  - key: Fast deliveries demand control in tight spaces. Hold LEFT CTRL while moving
      downhill to begin a slide.
    text: Tight route ahead. Move downhill and hold LEFT CTRL to slide.
  - key: Stay low beneath the gate, then jump from the runway to carry your speed
      across the gap.
    text: Keep your head down, then use your speed to jump the gap.
  - key: Now combine both lessons. Shoot every moving target while sliding through
      the final lane.
    text: 'Final lane: slide fast, shoot faster, and don''t let a single target escape.'
  - key: The finish gate opens when the last target falls. Reach it without losing
      your courier momentum.
    text: The last target opens the finish. Keep your speed and punch through.
  - key: Heavy cargo routes may require the bazooka. It carries one rocket, but no
      other courier weapon can match its impact.
    text: Heavy route, heavy answer. The bazooka holds one rocket, but one is usually
      plenty.
  - key: Fire at the reinforced red wall ahead. Only a heavy impact can breach this
      training barrier.
    text: Fire at the reinforced red wall ahead. Only a heavy impact can breach this
      training barrier.
  - key: Rockets take time to travel. Start reloading while you continue forward.
    text: Rockets aren't instant. Fire, reload on the move, and don't wait around
      for the fireworks.
  - key: Now use the blast for movement. Jump, look down and slightly behind you,
      then fire at the orange training plate.
    text: Now use the blast for movement. Jump, look down and slightly behind you,
      then fire at the orange training plate.
  - key: The blast pushes you away from its impact point. Hold forward in the air
      and land on the platform above.
    text: The blast throws you away from the impact. Hold forward in the air and
      stick the landing above.
  - key: A trained Corps courier can also use a bazooka to redirect in mid-air.
    text: A good courier can even change direction mid-air. A rocket helps.
  - key: Jump forward and fire at the orange plate on the left wall. Its blast will
      push you right toward the next platform.
    text: Jump forward and fire at the orange plate on the left wall. Its blast will
      push you right toward the next platform.
  - key: Final sequence. Breach the reinforced wall and reload while running.
    text: Final sequence. Breach the reinforced wall and reload while running.
  - key: At the edge, jump and fire at the orange plate behind you. Ride the blast
      toward the finish.
    text: At the edge, jump and fire at the orange plate behind you. Ride the blast
      toward the finish.
  - key: Recruit, this is your Space Delivery Corps licensing exam. Cross the start
      line to begin the timer, then use everything you learned to reach the finish.
      Pass this test and your courier license will unlock real delivery assignments.
      Training recovery remains active here; outside this facility, it will not save
      you.
    text: This is it, rookie - your licensing run. Cross the line, beat the course,
      and earn real assignments. Recovery still works here. Out there, nobody pulls
      you back.
